Package: devos-deb-installer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, dpkg, apt, shared-mime-info, desktop-file-utils, pkexec | policykit-1, sudo
Maintainer: DevOS <security@devos.local>
Description: DevOS App Installer — .deb files ke liye GUI installer
 .deb file par double-click karne se DevOS App Installer khulta hai:
 package ka naam/version/size dikhata hai, polkit se password leta hai
 (DevOS polkit agent) aur `apt-get install -y ./file.deb` se install
 karta hai — dependencies bhi khud resolve hoti hain.
